WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:05.110
Great organizations get ahead
by investing in data science teams.

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:06.780
But many of those
teams still depend

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:09.150
on outdated tools and systems.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:11.320
Data scientists don't
have an easy way to share

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:13.020
their hard-earned
knowledge and that

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:16.740
creates a gap between data
scientists and decision makers.

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:21.160
At RStudio, we build tools that
empower data scientists.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.240
RStudio Connect gives your
data science team a push-button

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:29.200
publishing platform to turn
great code into great data products.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.860
products like
dashboards,  on-demand

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:35.250
&amp;amp; scheduled reports,
interactive applications

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.670
presentations, APIs and more.

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:41.490
All with enterprise
security and database

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:44.250
connectivity, at
scale, which makes

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:48.570
it easy for your team to close
that gap and influence others.

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:52.110
RStudio Connect runs
the R and Python code

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:54.160
that your team loves to write.

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:58.030
And it unlocks your insights,
so you can make better decisions.

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:00.270
Get the most out of
your data science teams

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:02.690
with RStudio Connect.

